<div class="container prose">
  <p>Unexplained high water bills, warm spots on the floor, or the sound of running water when everything is off can signal leaks under slab, behind walls, or in the yard. Houston’s expansive clay soils push on foundations and stress piping—we see pinhole leaks and fitting failures weekly.</p>
  <h2>Our process</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Pressure testing and acoustic listening to narrow the search zone</li>
    <li>Targeted access to minimize drywall or tile removal</li>
    <li>Repair or section replacement using quality materials</li>
    <li>Guidance on whether spot repair or repiping is the smarter long-term fix</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Fast action limits mold risk and foundation issues. If you suspect a leak, call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}.</p>
